{"id": "unknown-2026-11-18-011", "date": "2026-11-18", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 47, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "EU reaches provisional deal to accelerate renewable energy permitting", "content": "<p>The Council of the European Union and the European Parliament have reached a provisional agreement on new rules designed to accelerate permitting and grid connections for renewable energy projects across the bloc. EU member states will have 18 months to transpose the directive into national law following its formal adoption.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/18/eu-reaches-provisional-deal-to-accelerate-renewable-energy-permitting/\">EU reaches provisional deal to acc", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/18/eu-reaches-provisional-deal-to-accelerate-renewable-energy-permitting/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-18-012", "date": "2026-11-18", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 47, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["concerns"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "France unveils bidding terms for 500 MW technology-neutral renewables tender", "content": "<p>France’s energy regulator has outlined the terms for a 500 MW technology-neutral renewables tender covering solar, wind and hydropower. The proposed rules introduce an unweighted reference price, raising concerns over market risks, financing costs and limited PV capacity.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/18/france-unveils-bidding-terms-for-500-mw-technology-neutral-renewables-tender/\">France unveils bidding terms for 500 MW technology-neutral renewables tender</a> ", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/18/france-unveils-bidding-terms-for-500-mw-technology-neutral-renewables-tender/", "type": "rss"}]}
